  - line: 23
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_continuity_flags.vek'tar_state: Vek'tar phases bodily into the Shard."
  - line: 24
    type: narration
    text: "Luminaire detects his chroniton signature and consciousness within its temporal matrix and explicitly says he is not dead but elsewhere."
  - line: 25
    type: narration
    text: "His original body disposition and recovery mechanism are not separately explained."
  - line: 26
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_continuity_flags.decay_jump: Chroniton decay rises from the Applicator's 78% reading to Vek'tar's 94% claim without a stated duration or cause."
  - line: 27
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_continuity_flags.armor_damage: Dragon Mail becomes spiderwebbed with additional cracks and glowing strain."
  - line: 28
    type: narration
    text: "No earlier wing or armor repair is supplied."
